	<section_number>1-223</section_number>
	<catch_line>Month; year</catch_line>
	<text>
		"Month" means a calendar month and "year" means a calendar year.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1919, § 5; Code 1950, § 1-13; 1950, pp. 22, 24, §§ 1-13.13, 1-13.33; 2005, c. 839.</history>
